# Neon Free billing (Mafia Wars)

Org **Sayed** (`org-still-lake-29205772`) stays on Neon **Free ($0)** until the user upgrades it themselves in the Neon console.

## Never do

- Upgrade the org to Launch/Scale, or any paid Neon plan
- Edit, delete, or reconfigure `northline-revamp` or `northlinestore`
- Create projects outside name `mafia-wars` for this game
- Use any region other than `aws-ap-southeast-1` (Singapore) for `mafia-wars`
- Set compute above **0.25 CU**, or set `suspend_timeout_seconds` to `-1` (always on)
- Disable scale-to-zero
- Enable Object Storage, Functions, AI Gateway, Realtime, or Managed Auth on `mafia-wars`
- Put a Neon API key on the Oracle VM — production may only get `DATABASE_URL`
- Set production `DATABASE_URL` on Oracle until the user explicitly asks

## If a Free cap suspends the DB

Leave it suspended until the next billing period. Do **not** upgrade to turn it back on. Stop and ask the user.

## If a task needs a paid Neon feature

Stop and ask. Do not work around by upgrading.
